WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:08.303
One wolf lowered his slingshot. "Cleo?"

2
00:00:08.304 --> 00:00:12.933
"Tony!" Cleo looked at the other two.

3
00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:20.580
"Tilly! Rupert!"

4
00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:25.520
She couldn't believe her bad luck.

5
00:00:25.521 --> 00:00:28.558
Cleo knew these wolves from the city.

6
00:00:28.559 --> 00:00:32.124
She used to be in their gang.

7
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:36.768
Nearby she saw sacks of money.

8
00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:41.080
"What are you doing out west?" Cleo asked.

9
00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:47.321
Rupert giggled. "We’re robbing banks out here."

10
00:00:47.322 --> 00:00:51.116
"Don't tell Cleo that!" Tony snapped.

11
00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:54.378
"Remember what she did?"

12
00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:57.593
Cleo sure remembered.

13
00:00:57.594 --> 00:01:03.601
She ran away while those wolves robbed a bank in the city.

14
00:01:03.602 --> 00:01:06.225
Tilly glared at her.

15
00:01:06.226 --> 00:01:09.679
"You took off in our getaway wagon.

16
00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:13.948
We were stuck there and got arrested because of you."

17
00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:17.854
"You hurt a customer," Cleo said. "So

18
00:01:17.855 --> 00:01:21.194
I . . . quit." Tony

19
00:01:21.195 --> 00:01:26.816
raised an eyebrow. "What do you do now?" Cleo

20
00:01:26.817 --> 00:01:33.789
gulped. "Um . . ." Roscoe

21
00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:38.923
and Zeke were riding back to town. Roscoe

22
00:01:38.924 --> 00:01:42.869
saw the hoofprints that Cleo followed. He

23
00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:46.630
halted his horse and looked at Zeke. "Cleo

24
00:01:46.631 --> 00:01:48.915
is a city cat. She

25
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:51.311
could be lost. We

26
00:01:51.312 --> 00:01:55.907
should probably look for her." ***

27
00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:58.687
They followed the prints.

28
00:01:58.688 --> 00:02:01.978
Soon they saw a campfire.

29
00:02:01.979 --> 00:02:07.284
They got off their horses and sneaked closer.

30
00:02:07.285 --> 00:02:13.556
Cleo was with three wolves—and sacks of money!

31
00:02:13.557 --> 00:02:18.833
"I was right," Roscoe thought. "She's still a thief!"

32
00:02:18.834 --> 00:02:23.303
"You're all under arrest!" Roscoe shouted.

33
00:02:23.304 --> 00:02:25.954
"Including you, Cleo!"

34
00:02:25.955 --> 00:02:30.149
Cleo gasped. "I didn't steal anything!

35
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.196
I'm trying to be the sheriff!"

36
00:02:33.197 --> 00:02:36.764
"Sheriff?" Tony growled.

37
00:02:36.765 --> 00:02:40.615
"I knew we couldn't trust her!"

38
00:02:40.616 --> 00:02:44.550
The wolves drew their slingshots. Fwap! Fwap!

39
00:02:44.551 --> 00:02:46.252
Pebbles flew.

40
00:02:46.253 --> 00:02:50.092
Zeke ran off.

41
00:02:50.093 --> 00:02:54.183
Cleo hid behind a tree.

42
00:02:54.184 --> 00:02:57.966
Roscoe ducked behind a boulder.

43
00:02:57.967 --> 00:03:01.000
Pebbles zinged into Cleo's tree.

44
00:03:01.001 --> 00:03:04.298
Branches snapped off.

45
00:03:04.299 --> 00:03:10.650
Cleo bit her lip. "Maybe I shouldn't be the sheriff!"

46
00:03:10.651 --> 00:03:13.403
She jumped out and ran.

47
00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:17.245
"Get her!" Tony shouted.

48
00:03:17.246 --> 00:03:20.114
Cleo heard Rupert and Tilly behind her.

49
00:03:20.115 --> 00:03:23.001
She ran faster.

50
00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:27.998
Soon she lost them.

51
00:03:27.999 --> 00:03:31.798
She sat down to catch her breath.

52
00:03:31.799 --> 00:03:35.570
"I usually run from the police," she thought.

53
00:03:35.571 --> 00:03:41.806
"Now I'm running from bad guys too!" She sighed. "Maybe

54
00:03:41.807 --> 00:03:45.797
I should stop running." ***

55
00:03:45.798 --> 00:03:49.767
Roscoe watched the two outlaws chase Cleo.

56
00:03:49.768 --> 00:03:53.788
The dog was starting to wonder if he was wrong.

57
00:03:53.789 --> 00:03:58.048
"Maybe Cleo isn't friends with the wolves," he thought.

58
00:03:58.049 --> 00:04:01.191
"That means she's in danger because of me."

59
00:04:01.192 --> 00:04:04.072
Another pebble bounced off the boulder.

60
00:04:04.073 --> 00:04:07.139
"I know you're there!" Tony shouted.

61
00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:10.282
"You can't hide forever!"

62
00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:17.593
Roscoe leaped up and shot a pebble. Fwap!

63
00:04:17.594 --> 00:04:21.734
He ducked back down as another pebble flew toward him.

64
00:04:21.735 --> 00:04:24.716
"This is bad," Roscoe thought.

65
00:04:24.717 --> 00:04:28.184
"I'm stuck behind this boulder, and Cleo is in danger!"

66
00:04:28.185 --> 00:04:31.259
Just then he heard something.

67
00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:37.923
Someone was coming!

